---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Dale Sackrider"
  description="Learn more about Dale Sackrider: VP of Cloud Engineering, systems architect, and leader focused on cloud transformation and operational simplicity."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        About Me
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2">
        Reducing friction, simplifying systems, and building high-performing teams.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-content space-y-6">
      <p>
        I’ve spent my career trying to reduce friction, improve systems, and help teams deliver meaningful results.
      </p>

      <p>
        That work started early, automating repetitive tasks as a systems administrator, and grew into leading cloud and infrastructure transformations at enterprise scale. Along the way, I’ve worked across operations, architecture, platform engineering, and people leadership — always with the same basic goal: <strong>make things work better, make them simpler, and make them easier for people to build on.</strong>
      </p>

      <p>
        Over the years, I’ve helped organizations improve availability, performance, compliance, and cost efficiency through standardization, automation, and clear operational design. I’ve built teams, developed reference architectures, led cloud transformation efforts, and supported large-scale environments serving thousands of workloads and customers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-8 mb-4">
        Enterprise Cloud & Leadership
      </h2>

      <p>
        At <strong>SAP’s Global Cloud Services</strong>, I partnered on large-scale multi-cloud strategy and simplification work that removed unnecessary complexity, retired competing internal platforms, and helped migrate thousands of customers to more stable, secure, performant, and cost-effective infrastructure.
      </p>

      <p>
        Today, I serve as <strong>Vice President of Cloud Engineering at Frontline Education</strong>, where I focus on building and scaling high-performing teams across SRE, DevOps, and data disciplines. My work centers on reliability, scalability, security, and making sure cloud strategy supports real outcomes for the educators and administrators our platforms serve.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mt-8 mb-4">
        Why I Write
      </h2>

      <p>
        This site is where I write about leadership, cloud engineering, operational excellence, and the occasional lesson from life outside of work. Some posts are practical, some are reflective, and some are just me trying to think clearly in public.
      </p>

      <p>
        If something here resonates with you, feel free to connect or reach out.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Actions (outside prose container to prevent style interference) -->
    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://linkedin.com/in/sackrider"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium text-sm transition-colors shadow-sm"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.28 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.75M6.46 10.9v8.37H9.2V10.9H6.46M7.83 6.2a1.64 1.64 0 0 0-1.66 1.64 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.66 1.65 1.64 1.64 0 0 0 1.64-1.65A1.64 1.64 0 0 0 7.83 6.2z"/>
        </svg>
        Connect on LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
      <a
        href="/#articles"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-800 font-medium text-sm transition-colors"
      >
        Read Recent Articles →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
